    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The suburb of Zonnebloem, once part of District Six, became home to freed slaves, merchants, labourers and immigrants.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zonnebloem"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "District Six’s geographic size and location have shaped its history and continue to guide its revitalization today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://bokaap.org/district-six-exploring-the-rich-history-of-cape-towns-iconic-neighbourhood/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The District Six Museum now occupies a former Methodist Church building and a neighboring warehouse, symbolically at the edge of the heritage site.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.districtsix.co.za/"
    },
    {
